Changes: Windows-only in-memory key capture; no key file or plaintext database;
stable DB/WAL/SHM double reads; WAL rolling checksums and commit boundaries;
exact group/time filtering; auditable batch review and offline report rendering.

The in-memory capture strategy scans only attached local WXWork.exe processes
for candidate wxSQLite3 key material and accepts a candidate only when it
validates the selected database page. No Tencent client code is redistributed.
